{"id":"22bad1b580e74bd2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-generic-column-independence.md","title":"1-generic 的全部列可计算独立","display":"thm-generic-column-independence — 1-generic 的全部列可计算独立","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-generic-column-independence","aliases":["20-thm-generic-column-independence"],"display":"thm-generic-column-independence — 1-generic 的全部列可计算独立","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.3.5(iv)–(v)","source_printed_pages":[139],"source_pdf_pages":[173],"depends_on":["[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-df-computable-independence]]","[[20-df-column-extraction]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-generic-column-independence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-generic-column-independence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-column-independence — 1-generic 的全部列可计算独立"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.3.5(iv)–(v)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>139</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>173</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"96978d2a748174af\" href=\"?note=96978d2a748174af\" title=\"20-df-computable-independence\">20-df-computable-independence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ca84a186d953c49\" href=\"?note=2ca84a186d953c49\" title=\"20-df-column-extraction\">20-df-column-extraction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(G\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)\">\\(\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\operatorname{Col}(G,i)\">\\(A_i=\\operatorname{Col}(G,i)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"96978d2a748174af\" href=\"?note=96978d2a748174af\" title=\"20-df-computable-independence\">20-df-computable-independence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ca84a186d953c49\" href=\"?note=2ca84a186d953c49\" title=\"20-df-column-extraction\">20-df-column-extraction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}column\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompIndependent}((A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}column\\text{-}independence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompIndependent}((A_i)_{i\\in\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,e\">\\(i,e\\)</span>，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{J_{\\ne i}(\\vec A)}=\\chi_{A_i}\">\\(\\Phi_e^{J_{\\ne i}(\\vec A)}=\\chi_{A_i}\\)</span>。定义 c.e. 串集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>：有限串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，若它规定某个第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 列的位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，且用其已规定的其他列、并把第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 列恒置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 所作有限 oracle 计算在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 停止并与该位不同。这一定义只使用有限停止见证。</p>\n<p>真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 不会碰到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，故 generic 给出避开前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\preceq G\">\\(\\sigma\\preceq G\\)</span>。选一个编码位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,n\\rangle\\ge|\\sigma|\">\\(\\langle i,n\\rangle\\ge|\\sigma|\\)</span>。真实删列 oracle 上的全计算在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 停止；取其有限查询信息，并保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，最后把第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 位写成不同值，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的有限延伸属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。该位不影响删列计算，故延伸有效，与避开矛盾。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,e\">\\(i,e\\)</span> 均被排除，得到强独立性，特别得到不同列两两不可比。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.3.5(iv)–(v)；印刷页 139；PDF 第 173 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-1gen","status"